-- title:
--   Uniqueness from traces modulo strict equivalence
-- statement:
--   Fix a finite index type $n$ with decidable equality, a topological group $G$, and a commutative local ring $\mathcal{O}$ (all in the same universe). Let $A$ and $B$ be objects of [`Deformation.ProartinianCat`](def/Deformations_ProartinianCat.html#L44) $\mathcal{O}$, i.e. topological local $\mathcal{O}$-algebras that are pro-Artinian, with local structure map and with residue field induced from that of $\mathcal{O}$, and let $f, g \colon A \to B$ be two morphisms in that category. Let $\sigma \colon G \to \mathrm{GL}_n(A)$ be a continuous group homomorphism. Assume (i) that [`Deformation.traceSubalgebra`](def/Deformations_TraceAlgebra.html#L56) of $\sigma$ is $\top$, that is, the topological closure of the $\mathcal{O}$-subalgebra of $A$ generated by the set $\{\operatorname{tr} \sigma(x) : x \in G\}$ is the whole of $A$; and (ii) that the two pushforwards $f_*\sigma$ and $g_*\sigma$ — obtained by applying $f$ entrywise to matrices, as in [`Deformation.mapRepn`](def/Deformations_TraceAlgebra.html#L29) — have the same class in $(\mathrm{Deformation.repnQuotFunctor}\ n\ G\ \mathcal{O}).obj\ B$, the quotient of the set of continuous homomorphisms $G \to \mathrm{GL}_n(B)$ by the conjugation action of the subgroup of $\mathrm{ConjAct}(\mathrm{GL}_n(B))$ corresponding to the kernel of $\mathrm{GL}_n(B) \to \mathrm{GL}_n(k)$, $k$ the residue field of $B$. The conclusion is $f = g$.
--
--   This is the uniqueness half of the trace-algebra approach to representability of deformation functors: if a continuous representation topologically generates its coefficient ring by its traces, then a morphism of coefficient rings is determined by the strict equivalence class of the pushed-forward representation. It is used in [`Deformation.isCorepresentable_conjQuotSubfunctor_of_descends`](thm.html#Deformation.isCorepresentable_conjQuotSubfunctor_of_descends), where it supplies the uniqueness of morphisms out of a trace-generated object.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_Deformation_hom_ext_of_mk_mapRepn_eq.lean

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_Deformations_TraceAlgebra

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

open CategoryTheory IsLocalRing

universe u v

theorem Deformation.hom_ext_of_mk_mapRepn_eq {n : Type} [Fintype n] [DecidableEq n] {G : Type u} [Group G]
    [TopologicalSpace G] {𝓞 : Type u} [CommRing 𝓞] [IsLocalRing 𝓞] {A B : Deformation.ProartinianCat 𝓞} {f g : A ⟶ B}
    {σ : G →ₜ* GL n A} (hσ : Deformation.traceSubalgebra 𝓞 σ = ⊤)
    (h : (Quotient.mk'' (Deformation.mapRepn n G 𝓞 f σ) : (Deformation.repnQuotFunctor n G 𝓞).obj B) =
      Quotient.mk'' (Deformation.mapRepn n G 𝓞 g σ)) : f = g := by sorry
